// ABOUTME: Overlaps two outlined triangles whose intersections imply a shifting quadrilateral.
// ABOUTME: Demonstrates how closure favors the simpler triangular forms over their shared shape.
// Adapted from Fabian Morón Zirfas's Triangle and Quad:
// https://github.com/ff6347/gestalten-in-code/tree/e8b8f8446c13c01494ccfd1e92ce2bb1638daf66/form/2d/processing/triangle_and_quad

background("#ffffff");
noFill();
stroke("#000000");
strokeWidth(1);
triangle(34, 3, 54, 95, 126, 31);
triangle(4, 56, 75, 114, 90, 24);
